target_patent.independent_claim:
A computer-implemented method comprising:
receiving a first output of a language model based on the language model processing a first input, wherein the first input comprises: a first request, target content, and one or more examples, the one or more examples include one or more model outputs associated with the first request, and wherein the first output comprises a first output confidence;
